        1953,
        1527
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This conference produced a series of major recommendations to promote the progress of New York City's Puerto Rican population. The papers which emerged from the sessions are now being processed and will be sent to you within a few days. They affect the work and programs of virtually every city agency.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2866,
          "min": -1.5726
